<description>&lt;p&gt;Aung San Suu Kyi spoke with her son for the first time in over five years and received a package of books and letters from King Charles III, a gesture acknowledged by Myanmar authorities. Min Aung Hlaing met Japan envoy Sasakawa, indicating diplomatic engagement despite ongoing fighting. The conflict continues to cause civilian casualties, with 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. These personal contacts and the royal outreach are new developments compared with earlier reports of a drone strike on a Chinese gas pipeline and Arakan Army actions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/22/aung-san-suu-kyi-son-speaks-former-myanmar-leader&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQejhmU25UdXc3dUkybk9XcGlYWTdtaGJBQzJ4TEZXdVAzSWt2S192OURVSmtWQmc2dmpCSWw1WVo3X3pYSDFWZlJ5dEhnZUl2THBNdlhQSDJxM2UyNnBDZVFMYUdDbGdHRlBudFdMWGdWX21nbzRHRGQwSFoyYnA0Y1RFaHNRM18xZkluTlVjSFhiWnVfSkRjUGRIT3U0ZW9wY1lZaVJpNHA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPYkd3TFJpcjVVOHhyNGhGODVnZzZtNlc5VEFLcVIyMFEyVzY2aGhSOHVKUy1nTTZ0ektqc0ZmN2V6QzZPTjR4SFhTVk9jNWVMY3NhYTdRMjVfZHBGSUNTb0g4ZGN4NWZNMUFNN0oxSm1ZTEhEcEpsSlJpX1M1a1NVYWc3elAwZ1RLcDZpZ3pSZlFlOExxdFUwYzVyMHU4ZVUwc01NZmtiekd6OXBVUmJkTm1vWGd2YUhqaG5XdzlORlA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h